Prerequisites & Installation
Navigate to your project directory:

Bash
cd /root/openaiproject
Create and activate a virtual environment, then install the required dependencies:

Bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install openai
Ensure your API credentials (OPENAI_API_KEY and OPENAI_API_BASE) are configured in your environment or /root/.bash_profile.

Usage
Run the summarizer.py script directly to generate a one-line summary from the default paragraph:

Bash
python3 summarizer.py
Python Function Preview
Python
import os
from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(
    api_key=os.environ.get("OPENAI_API_KEY"),
    base_url=os.environ.get("OPENAI_API_BASE")
)

def summarize(text: str) -> str:
    prompt = f"Summarize the following paragraph into a single-line summary:\n\n{text}"
    
    response = client.chat.completions.create(
        model="gpt-5.6-luna",
        messages=[
            {"role": "user", "content": prompt}
        ],
        max_tokens=80,
        temperature=0.5
    ).choices[0].message.content.strip()
    
    return response
